/android/app/release

# Generated code
#
# NOTE: generated Dart files are deliberately NOT ignored. Every provider
# file has `part '*.g.dart'`, so ignoring them leaves a fresh clone unable to
# compile until codegen is run by hand. The requirements doc (Olona
# Requirements.md, "Go and Flutter conventions") says to keep generated code
# "out of code review focus but in version control", and CI runs
# build_runner then fails if the committed output differs.
